note as BIZ_diagram_20_diagnostics
  BUSINESS PURPOSE
  Connects laboratory and imaging workflows to the patient chart while the
  heavy binary content remains in PACS/VNA or governed object storage.
  Supports one report with many result observations, specimens, images and
  attachments instead of a single file link.
end note

