note as DICOMWEB_diagram_20_diagnostics
  DICOM / FILE RULES
  DICOM UIDs and stable retrieval URIs identify studies. Binary images remain
  in PACS/VNA or object storage. DICOMweb QIDO-RS queries, WADO-RS retrieval
  and STOW-RS storage are integration behaviors, not public URLs in tables.
end note

note as RESULTS_diagram_20_diagnostics
  RESULT INTEGRITY
  DiagnosticReport content is stored in immutable versions. Observation status
  and specimen chain-of-custody remain independently auditable. Corrections
  create an amended report version linked to the exact observations and files;
  they never overwrite a previously released clinical meaning.
end note

