note right of laboratory_accessions
  INTERNATIONAL LAB TRACEABILITY
  Order -> accession -> specimen/container custody -> work order/test -> analyzer message
  -> observation/report -> verification -> critical-result communication.
end note

note right of dicom_object_locations
  DICOM payloads remain in PACS/object storage. PostgreSQL stores governed identifiers,
  hashes, storage/version metadata, retention, encryption and clinical relationships.
end note

